        "織嘜 QR 碼（woven QR code label）是唯一會跟著成衣走完洗滌、轉售與回收全程的輔料，因此它是承載永久數位連結最自然的位置。但它同時也是最難做出可掃碼的位置：提花織機是一根紗一根紗織出圖像，解析度、對比與邊緣銳利度都受組織與紗線限制，而不是受印表機限制。這篇說明織嘜二維碼實際能裝多少資料、在哪些環節會失效，以及在訂 5,000 個之前該怎麼驗。",
        "A woven QR code label is the only trims component that stays with the garment through washing, resale and recycling, which makes it the natural home for a persistent digital link. It is also the hardest place to make a scannable code: a jacquard loom builds the image one yarn at a time, so resolution, contrast and edge sharpness are bounded by the weave and the yarn, not by a print head. This guide covers how much data a woven 2D code can really hold, where it fails, and how to test it before you commit 5,000 labels.",
